1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,910
Now we go to Jane who is going to tell us about what's happening

2
00:00:02,910 --> 00:00:03,920
in town this weekend.

3
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:05,206
Right, thanks Andrew,

4
00:00:05,206 --> 00:00:07,618
and now on to what's new,

5
00:00:07,618 --> 00:00:12,280
and do we really need yet another sports shop in Bradcaster?

6
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:17,038
Well, most of you probably know Sports World - the branch of a Danish

7
00:00:17,038 --> 00:00:20,290
sports goods company that opened a few years ago-

8
00:00:20,290 --> 00:00:22,764
it's attracted a lot of custom,

9
00:00:22,764 --> 00:00:27,610
and so the company has now decided to open another branch in the area.

10
00:00:27,610 --> 00:00:31,722
It's going to be in the shopping centre to the west of Bradcaster,

11
00:00:31,722 --> 00:00:35,553
so that will be good news for all of you who've found the original

12
00:00:35,553 --> 00:00:38,000
shop in the north of the town hard to get to.

13
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,862
I was invited to a special preview and I can promise you, this is

14
00:00:43,862 --> 00:00:46,130
the ultimate in sports retailing.

15
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:52,278
The whole place has been given a new minimalist look with the company's signature colours of black

16
00:00:52,278 --> 00:00:52,740
and red.

17
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:58,455
The first three floors have a huge range of sports clothing as well as

18
00:00:58,455 --> 00:00:59,719
equipment,

19
00:00:59,719 --> 00:01:03,930
and on the top floor there's a cafe and a book and DVD section.

20
00:01:03,930 --> 00:01:09,470
You'll find all the well-known names as well as some less well-known ones.

21
00:01:09,470 --> 00:01:14,913
If they haven't got exactly what you want in stock they promise to get

22
00:01:14,913 --> 00:01:16,440
it for you in ten days.

23
00:01:16,440 --> 00:01:20,430
Unlike the other store, where it can take up to fourteen days.

24
00:01:20,430 --> 00:01:25,949
They cover all the major sports, including football, tennis and swimming,

25
00:01:25,949 --> 00:01:29,140
but they particularly focus on running,

26
00:01:29,140 --> 00:01:33,040
and they claim to have the widest range of equipment in the country.

27
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:37,671
As well as that, a whole section of the third floor is devoted to

28
00:01:37,671 --> 00:01:42,763
sports bags, including the latest designs from the States - if you can't find

29
00:01:42,763 --> 00:01:45,810
what you want here, it doesn't exist!

30
00:01:45,810 --> 00:01:52,405
The shop will be open from 9.00 am this Saturday

31
00:01:52,405 --> 00:01:55,772
and if you go along to the opening then you'll have the chance to

32
00:01:55,772 --> 00:01:59,200
meet the national 400 metres running champion Paul King,

33
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:01,369
who's coming along to open the shop,

34
00:02:01,369 --> 00:02:07,534
and he will be staying around until about midday to chat to any fans who want to meet him

35
00:02:07,534 --> 00:02:09,040
and sign autographs.

36
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:14,020
Then there will be a whole range of special attractios all weekend.

37
00:02:14,020 --> 00:02:19,363
There will be free tickets for local sporting events for the first 50 customers,

38
00:02:19,363 --> 00:02:23,200
and also a special competition open to all.

39
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:29,700
Just answer fifteen out of twenty sports questions correctly to win a signed copy

40
00:02:29,700 --> 00:02:32,910
of Paul King's DVD 'Spring Tips',

41
00:02:32,910 --> 00:02:37,979
while the first person to get all the questions correct gets a year's free

42
00:02:37,979 --> 00:02:39,970
membership of the Bradcaster Gym.

43
00:02:39,970 --> 00:02:46,925
All entrants will receive a special Sports calendar with details of all Bradcaster fixtures

44
00:02:46,925 --> 00:02:47,890
in the coming year.

45
00:02:47,890 --> 00:02:55,149
One of the special opening offers is a fitness test-a complete review of your cardiac fitness

46
00:02:55,149 --> 00:02:59,600
and muscle tone, actually done in the shop by qualified staff.

47
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:06,100
This would normally cost 30.00 but is available at half price for this month

48
00:03:06,100 --> 00:03:06,150
only.

49
00:03:06,150 --> 00:03:10,178
There are only a limited number of places available for this,

50
00:03:10,178 --> 00:03:15,000
so to make a booking phone 560341.

51
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:21,747
In addition, if you open an account you get lots more special offers including

52
00:03:21,747 --> 00:03:24,900
the chance to try out equipment at special open evenings….
